@base = http://localhost:8081

### 以 exp08 profile 启动，再运行。正常注册，预期 code=200。
POST {{base}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"exp08-manual","password":"Exp08DemoOnly123","nickname":"AOP事务实验用户"}

### 预期 users=1 roles=1 USER=1
GET {{base}}/tx-demo/state/exp08-manual

### 真实唯一约束异常，预期业务code=50001（项目HTTP状态约定仍为200）
POST {{base}}/tx-demo/duplicate-role
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"exp08-rollback","password":"Exp08DemoOnly123","nickname":"回滚用户"}

### 预期 users=0 roles=0
GET {{base}}/tx-demo/state/exp08-rollback

### existingUserId需取预先已提交的用户ID，两种传播实验见验证脚本
